                    "statement": "When no cached shape is available, ShapeCache.generateElementShape calls the module-level _generateElementShape(element, ShapeCache.rg, renderConfig || { isExporting: false, canvasBackgroundColor: COLOR_PALETTE.white, embedsValidationStatus: null }) from ./Shape, to actually generate a new roughjs shape using the cached RoughGenerator instance.",
